{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8b9433c710f1eeeabfbe7e779bc38c0c994b0d8fe4f261b9fb2c4e8e15875125", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。朋花を誘って足湯へ向かった。\n足湯は、長い石段の先にあった……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。邀请朋花一起去泡足汤。足汤就在漫长石阶的尽头……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "202f5455625aa441a5c85f715276a79d402de43e824e2a20cdb8191dfb26f0b2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、紅葉が綺麗ですよ～。\n空気も澄んでいて、素敵な景色ですね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，红叶真漂亮呀～。\n空气也很清新，景色真好呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1c9d9f3d02dbeaa242bde3086336a31d644657759e3e31bcf6397151626302ad", "ja": "ハア、ハア……そ、そうだな……。\n……ふぅ。", "zh": "呼、呼……是、是啊……。\n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "b9a823a503a2067b5066e7f7c9e58d967ff743b832c3d95479eaa6e66d16ac05", "ja": "どうしたんですか～？　そんなに息を切らして……。\nまさか、疲れたなんて言いませんよね～？", "zh": "怎么了～？喘得这么厉害……\n该不会要说自己累了吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8a70fd844e320699111c043a6322d427cb9088cc0a879f5b7dcbff1472291065", "ja": "す、すまん。運動不足で石段を上るのも、\nやっとなんだ……。朋花は、平気そうだな？", "zh": "对、对不起。因为平时缺乏运动，爬这些石阶都已经很勉强了……朋花看起来倒是没事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "489e1b5797dc19781f0fa39b52d6f2051bb843c9174b28a350fe3ba9d04f861a", "ja": "ええ、これくらい大したことはありません～。\nですが、困ってしまいましたね～。", "zh": "嗯，这点程度根本不算什么～  \n不过，这下可伤脑筋了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "fb539210261c3fcc2d3e710175658add4c403e1b026409fad15029c6ca4cf769", "ja": "せっかくのお出かけで、\n私なりに張り切ってきたのですが……。", "zh": "难得出来一趟，我也拿出了自己的干劲，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "ec49c14bfa3298f30529056a3a75215fce761c75ef536b34e1faf82974a404d1", "ja": "そのように疲れた顔をされては、\n楽しい気分も、どこかに行ってしまいます～。", "zh": "您露出这么疲惫的表情，连我的好心情都要跑掉了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2de719a8470ee38cbe2a8fc995538a6e093e3fdb80efc94e1263eb6270254f9f", "ja": "あ……すまん。疲れた顔はしないって約束するよ！\n朋花の楽しみを、台無しにしたくはないからな。", "zh": "啊……抱歉。我保证不会摆出疲惫的表情了！\n我可不想毁了朋花的兴致。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "0fed0032f3697dfd8d83faf49defd687f374edfe5a1428806b472364890dd009", "ja": "ええ。わかればいいんですよ～。貴重な聖母の休みを\n共に過ごしているという自覚をもってください～。", "zh": "嗯，明白了就好～请记住，您现在正和圣母共度这段宝贵的休息时光～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1010_p", "source_sha256": "28444ded6f623eebe046ee330504dbd286e23da8e844c60058b505e5af10e141", "ja": "そうだよな……。ここの足湯は、評判がよくてね。\nきっと、朋花の期待に応えられると思う。", "zh": "没错……这里的足浴口碑很好。\n一定能满足朋花的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "feecc7835cb9ef8c74a6e7fa6a0ca78c54e205710790690337b1ad14ac606d44", "ja": "そうなんですか？　それは楽しみですね～。\nあっ。見てください、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "是这样吗？那真让人期待呢～\n啊，请看，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "701f1ea5d9e306a20ae7b8bcb835938d4e6b6bcd156a02fa59df3664a65a98a9", "ja": "紅葉がひらひらと舞って……。\nとても幻想的な風景ですね～。……本当に綺麗です。", "zh": "红叶纷纷飘落……\n真是一幅梦幻般的景色呢～……真的很美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "27c63fa16e1f8677a4fdd2785efdfca0382c11f71a92b8bd0350c0384d3b51e4", "ja": "そうだな……。今日の朋花は、\nなんだか歳相応の女の子って感じがするな。", "zh": "是啊……今天的朋花，总觉得有种符合年龄的女孩子的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "3b5655a00b5f560eb41ce0aed4fa9b405dd185e1037f92e5a9fc190ca9712815", "ja": "ふふっ、おかしな{$P$}さんですね。\n今日の私は、聖母ではないと？", "zh": "呵呵，真是奇怪的{$P$}先生呢。\n意思是，今天的我不是圣母吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a6dc55759631b4619e8b7943ecd5b0917fa64b28446f0cd8cf4a6fed7eca0c76", "ja": "ああ。でも、たまにはいいんじゃないか？\nそういう日があって。聖母にもオフは必要だからな！", "zh": "啊，不过偶尔这样一天也不错吧？圣母也需要休息日啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "05eff295498eb95df0be0e648ab447edb10b386fc43701e5071dc496d46cce42", "ja": "……うふふ。そんなことを言って、\n今、休みたいのは、あなたの方ですよね～？", "zh": "……呵呵，嘴上这么说，\n现在想休息的人，其实是你吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "b4f4f2e46c752fbf46464b54b0a32e39bf2a756cb8143c56be221e1505cef681", "ja": "これだけ会話ができるなら、休憩は終わりです。\nさあ、行きますよ、{$P$}さん～。", "zh": "既然还能聊这么多，休息就结束了。好了，该走了，{$P$}先生～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8a24ec8864331222181a37abee71f099378eb4b96463325b587c8a0c3c6c514e", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、もう少し休みを……！", "zh": "诶！？不，再让休息一会儿……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0354_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "d319392b4ccff3f4e55b25a736ed6491ee97fd4742bac8b9b2fbbdcd0bbb5229", "ja": "「疲れた顔はしない」……確かに聞きましたよ～。\n聖母との約束、忘れないでくださいね～♪　ふふっ。", "zh": "“不会露出疲惫的神色”……我确实听到了哦～。\n和圣母的约定，可不要忘记了哦～♪　呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
